 No. | Dependency | Computation method | Result
 ----+------------+--------------------+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 1.  |            | given              | sk = b461b0c47b597a5eb9c9e38856533e802954a8e6ed1b6dd3f34e891b4912c8b1
 2.  |            | given              | timestamp = 1794328772185
 3.  |            | lastNonce          | nonce = 9223372036854775807
 4.  | 1,         | secp256k1          | pk = 04b5e7d2c17c8a08b1c5983cd6def4124faa345698eada20c91f0a47406f8827c9cdb80f2e514b4b03b2d3a73501c500f675c756867dcbf9fcad57fa7412acb22e
 5.  | 2, 4, 3,   | registry           | value = (1794328772185, 04b5e7d2c17c8a08b1c5983cd6def4124faa345698eada20c91f0a47406f8827c9cdb80f2e514b4b03b2d3a73501c500f675c756867dcbf9fcad57fa7412acb22e, 9223372036854775807)
 6.  | 5,         | protobuf           | toSign = 2a65aa01620a092a0710b2f9a1e5b8680a462a44ca014104b5e7d2c17c8a08b1c5983cd6def4124faa345698eada20c91f0a47406f8827c9cdb80f2e514b4b03b2d3a73501c500f675c756867dcbf9fcad57fa7412acb22e0a0d2a0b10feffffffffffffffff01
 7.  | 6, 1,      | secp256k1          | sig = 3045022100cb64110905f0634967f9f6e3e20eb998b86dffd21121dd94848bc2f2355ca29202206fce173639fdf67d1fbcb0d6c06154193d9d4bf1b3c8ca857f18f2be05c27863
 8.  | 4,         | registry           | uri = rho:id:csx8wjodypw4iet7sejtojrys9ampbn81sz3tqj9z6z3rymu6udhhb
